; =============================================================================
; Pegstd 1.0 — pure Pegassus IR standard library
; No external binaries. No exec. No files.
; ABI: args/results in locals 240-249; temps 250-255. App code: use 0-229.
; Include:
;   jmp main
;   include pegstd.ir
;   lab main
; =============================================================================

